{"id":"wb-7-1321","name":"泸县龙桥群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"瀘縣龍橋群","text":"泸县龙桥群位于四川省泸州市泸县。泸县的明清古桥遍布全县，不少古桥皆在桥墩顶部雕刻有石龙，故得名“龙桥”，是中国唯一的明清龙桥群。泸县龙桥已考证的最早建造时间在北宋治平年间，明、清两代建造最为盛行，尤以明代的洪武、嘉靖、万历和清代康熙、乾隆、嘉庆等时期为盛。\n2007年6月1日公布为第七批四川省文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%80%98%E7%B8%A3%E9%BE%8D%E6%A9%8B%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":93099158,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93099158","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/81a1a0310c3f33aabacde3df.jpg","title":"泸县龙桥群顺对子大桥照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B3%B8%E5%8E%BF%E9%BE%99%E6%A1%A5%E7%BE%A4%E9%A1%BA%E5%AF%B9%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A7%E6%A1%A5%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/%E6%B3%B8%E5%8E%BF%E9%BE%99%E6%A1%A5%E7%BE%A4%E9%A1%BA%E5%AF%B9%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A7%E6%A1%A5%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Luxian dragon bridges -- Sunduizi Bridge","width":320,"height":213}}